```
function prefixSumArray(arr) {
  let prefixSums = [0];
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    prefixSums[i+1] = prefixSums[i] + arr[i];
  }
  return prefixSums;
}
```

And here's a function that uses the prefix sum array to return the sum of a subarray between two indices 'l' and 'r':

```
function sumSubarray(l, r, prefixSums) {
  return prefixSums[r+1] - prefixSums[l];
}
```

