    public int subtract(int x, int y) {
        return x - y;
    }

    //method 3: Calculates average of two integer values
    public double average(int x, int y) {
        return (x + y) / 2.0;
    }
}
```

This class has three methods: `add()`, `subtract()`, and `average()` that perform basic arithmetic operations on two integer values. The first two methods return an integer value while the third method returns a double value.

